::  Ashvini a1 · Equinox e209 — first Tend gate that does work (beyond pedestals).
::  Thin bartis: one @u32 sample from argv, answer with its predecessor (dec).
::  Names the Tally Tend family in src/lib/; Rye lower still owns the math.
::  Stem law: gate-*-u32 stems accept exactly one sample.
|=  sample=@u32
%-  dec  sample
